flowchart TD
    A[Start app] --> B[Add text or upload file]
    B --> C[Validate file type, size, and content]
    C --> D[Detect language]
    D --> E[Persist document]
    E --> F[Create or cache embedding]
    F --> G[User submits question]
    G --> H[Embed question and rank documents]
    H --> I{Relevant context found?}
    I -->|No| J[Return no-context response]
    I -->|Yes| K{Groq configured?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Generate grounded answer]
    K -->|No or provider fails| M[Extractive fallback answer]
    J --> N[Save Q&A history]
    L --> N
    M --> N
    N --> O[Show answer, sources, and history]
